{"t":"Powerless","s":"powerless-88678","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Powerless_Icon_2d9ad2.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Powerless</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F13.40.54ea79\">13.40.54ea79</a><br/>July 01, 2024<br/>Summer Update 2024</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Feared\">Feared</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rooted\">Rooted</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Powerless Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Powerless_Icon_2d9ad2.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span> <b>Powerless</b> is a Special Condition that prevents characters from casting attack spells or using offensive runes.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-How_to_be_afflicted_by_Powerless\">How to be afflicted by Powerless</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Soulpit\">Soulpit</span></h3>\n<p>The final foe in a Soulpit challenge has a chance to be able to afflict this condition.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Candia\">Candia</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Daddy\">Sugar Daddy</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Candia\">Candia</a> also afflicts this condition.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Azzilon\">Azzilon</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Arbaziloth\">Arbaziloth</a> afflicts players close to him with this condition quite often during its bossfight.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-How_to_get_rid_of_the_Powerless_Condition\">How to get rid of the Powerless Condition</span></h2>\n<p>There is no way to get rid of this condition but by waiting for it to wear off.\n</p>\n</div>","quests":["make-believe-quest"]}